@ ---- Texts ----
HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorCastformBefore::
	.string "They say CASTFORM only show\nthemselves when the weather turns.\pLook around ROUTES 119, 120 and\n123 when the sky turns!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorCastformAfter::
	.string "Somebody caught a CASTFORM! So it\nreally does ride the weather near\lthe WEATHER INSTITUTE.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorCastformNotes::
	.string "Something near the WEATHER\nINSTITUTE changes with the sky…\pIt only appears when the\nweather turns.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorFeebasBefore::
	.string "A fisherman swears ROUTE 119's\nriver hides a POKéMON nobody else\lcan find.\pOnly a few spots in the whole\nriver, he says!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorFeebasAfter::
	.string "So FEEBAS really lives in ROUTE\n119's river! Only a handful of\lspots, too.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorFeebasNotes::
	.string "A shabby fish hides in a long\nriver in HOENN. Only a few spots\lin it, and they change…$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorMasquerainBefore::
	.string "In HOENN, MASQUERAIN only flutter\nout of the grass on rainy days.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorMasquerainAfter::
	.string "Somebody caught a MASQUERAIN in\nthe rain! I knew those rainy days\lwere worth it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorMasquerainNotes::
	.string "A bug with eye-patterned wings\nonly comes out on HOENN's\lrainy days.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorLaprasBefore::
	.string "Every Friday, a LAPRAS is said to\nsing deep down in UNION CAVE.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorLaprasAfter::
	.string "Somebody met UNION CAVE's Friday\nLAPRAS! Its song is real\lafter all.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorLaprasNotes::
	.string "Deep in a JOHTO cave, a song can\nbe heard once a week. Which day\lwas it…?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipDaycare::
	.string "The DAY-CARE couple on ROUTE 34\nwill raise two POKéMON for you.\pLeave two that get along, and one\nday they may find an EGG!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipBugContest::
	.string "The BUG-CATCHING CONTEST in\nJOHTO's NATIONAL PARK runs\levery day.\pCatch the best BUG POKéMON you can\nfind and you might win a prize!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipClock::
	.string "Did you know? The clock on the\nwall in any POKéMON CENTER lets\lyou set the day and the time.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipLevelCap::
	.string "With the LEVEL CAP on, your\nPOKéMON stop growing at the next\lGYM LEADER's level.\pEvery BADGE you win raises the cap\na little.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipWeather::
	.string "Some POKéMON only come out when\nthe weather turns.\pRainy days and stormy days bring\nout different faces in the grass!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipReminderJk::
	.string "A man in BLACKTHORN CITY can make\nPOKéMON remember moves\lthey've forgotten.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipNameraterJk::
	.string "The NAME RATER in GOLDENROD CITY\ncan give your POKéMON a\lbetter nickname.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipReminderH::
	.string "In FALLARBOR TOWN there's a MOVE\nREMINDER. He helps POKéMON\lremember forgotten moves.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipNameraterH::
	.string "The NAME RATER in SLATEPORT CITY\ncan change your\lPOKéMON's nicknames.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipMindReader::
	.string "A guru in MOSSDEEP CITY reads\nPOKéMON's minds.\pFor STAR PIECES, he can bring out\na POKéMON's hidden potential.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryStraitClosed::
	.string "See the rocks south of ROUTE 41?\nThere's a gap with a huge\lwhirlpool in it.\pPast it is the TIDAL STRAIT. Folks\nsay it runs all the way to HOENN,\lbut nobody gets through\lthat whirlpool.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryStraitOpen::
	.string "The whirlpool south of ROUTE 41\nhas calmed! Did you see it on TV?\pSURF through the gap in the rocks\nand follow the TIDAL STRAIT. It\lcomes out on HOENN's ROUTE 105.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryStraitDoneJ::
	.string "You SURFED the TIDAL STRAIT all\nthe way to HOENN? The sailors here\lwill be talking about that\lfor years!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryStraitH::
	.string "MR. BRINEY says the sea west of\nROUTE 105 is calm again. The TIDAL\lSTRAIT runs from there all the way\lto JOHTO!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipJkBases::
	.string "SECRET POWER works here too, not\njust in HOENN. There are hollow\ltrees in ILEX FOREST and\lVIRIDIAN FOREST.\pAnd cracked rock on ROUTE 45 and\ninside MT. MOON. Make a SECRET\lBASE in one!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipSites::
	.string "The old legendary sites are open\nagain: the desert ruins, SKY\lPILLAR, even the caves under\lthe sea.\pThe POKéMON that slept there are\ngone. TRAINERS are making SECRET\lBASES in them!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStorySilverCyndaquil::
	.string "Hmph. Wild CYNDAQUIL turn up in\nthe BURNED TOWER at night.\pGo catch one if you want. Mine\nwill still burn it to a crisp.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStorySilverTotodile::
	.string "Hmph. Something keeps stealing a\nfisherman's bait at the LAKE\lOF RAGE.\pIt's a wild TOTODILE. Bring a GOOD\nROD if you want it.\lMine's stronger.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStorySilverChikorita::
	.string "Hmph. There's a wild CHIKORITA in\na meadow off ROUTE 46.\pFollow the sweet smell by day.\nMine will never lose to it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryMomChikorita::
	.string "PROF. ELM dropped by today.\pHe says CHIKORITA families\nsunbathe in a meadow off ROUTE 46.\pHe thought you'd like to see them,\nsince yours started it all!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryMomCyndaquil::
	.string "PROF. ELM dropped by today.\pHe says TYPHLOSION nest in the\nBURNED TOWER at night.\pHe thought you'd like to see them,\nsince yours started it all!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryMomTotodile::
	.string "PROF. ELM dropped by today.\pHe says a FERALIGATR raises its\nTOTODILE in the LAKE OF RAGE.\pHe thought you'd like to see them,\nsince yours started it all!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryAideRunawayTotodile::
	.string "Our lab's TOTODILE is still\nloose somewhere.\pA fisherman at the LAKE OF RAGE\nkeeps losing his bait. That's\lour guess!\pIt knows our lab's smell. If it\nsees you, it'll come to you!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryAideRunawayChikorita::
	.string "Our lab's CHIKORITA is still\nloose somewhere.\pI saw it run into the tall grass\non ROUTE 46, by day.\pIt knows our lab's smell. If it\nsees you, it'll come to you!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryAideRunawayCyndaquil::
	.string "Our lab's CYNDAQUIL is still\nloose somewhere.\pSomeone saw it by ECRUTEAK's\nBURNED TOWER, after dark.\pIt knows our lab's smell. If it\nsees you, it'll come to you!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryAideChikorita::
	.string "The PROF. is writing about\nCHIKORITA on ROUTE 46.\pThere's a hidden meadow there.\nHave you seen them?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryAideCyndaquil::
	.string "The PROF. is writing about\nTYPHLOSION in the BURNED TOWER.\pThey bring their young there at\nnight. Have you seen them?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryAideTotodile::
	.string "The PROF. is writing about a\nFERALIGATR in the LAKE OF RAGE.\pIt raises its TOTODILE in the\nsouth cove. Have you seen them?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryBillGarden::
	.string "My grandson BILL says BULBASAUR\nmeet in a garden behind our house.\pIn the morning, slip through the\ntrees above the overlook!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryCeruleanCharmander::
	.string "The NURSE keeps looking out at\nthe rain.\pShe saw a CHARMANDER by NUGGET\nBRIDGE at dusk.\pIt was waiting in the rain. Its\nflame was so small…$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryFerry::
	.string "PROF. OAK is said to give TRAINERS\nwith all 16 BADGES a ticket for\lthe ship to HOENN.\pShips leave from VERMILION's port.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryNorman::
	.string "NORMAN of PETALBURG only battles\nTRAINERS who already have four\lHOENN BADGES.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryWattson::
	.string "WATTSON won't battle until someone\nfixes the generator in\lNEW MAUVILLE.\pHe's looking for a TRAINER\nto help!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryMeteorite::
	.string "The MOSSDEEP GYM twins won't\nbattle until the SPACE CENTER gets\lits meteorite back.\pCOZMO in FALLARBOR might know\nwhere one is.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryWinona::
	.string "FORTREE's GYM LEADER WINONA has\nbeen out by the WEATHER INSTITUTE\lon ROUTE 119.$"

